<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom says bought off-market at NZ$6.96.</title>
<headline>Telecom says bought off-market at NZ$6.96.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Wednesday that, as part of its NZ$1 billion share buyback programme, it had acquired 99,104 shares off-market on Tuesday at a price of NZ$6.96 each.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
